          "short": "$\\dfrac{6}{11}$",
          "worked": "Red and green are mutually exclusive outcomes.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{red or green})&=P(\\text{red})+P(\\text{green})\\\\P(\\text{red or green})&=\\frac{13+17}{55}\\\\P(\\text{red or green})&=\\frac{6}{11}\\end{align*}$$",
